    "detailed_description": "<strong>Colorful is a parkour hack-n-slash</strong> where you must restore color to the world. You play as Jonah, a young man that wakes up in an unknown lifeless world where strange dark creatures have consumed its color. Glide, wall run, and grind your way through a dreamlike landscape while battling the dark enemies that have consumed the color of the world! Experience Jonah\u2019s personal story while discovering the secrets behind the darkness!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950300/extras/923c15564a378a5bee46724f0baa2b59.avif?t=1723697668\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience a unique blend of parkour movement with hack-n-slash gameplay!<br></li><li><strong>A unique movement system</strong> for total freedom and fluidity!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950300/extras/99c8dd26f23e664420b00c4ab28491bc.poster.avif?t=1723697668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950300/extras/99c8dd26f23e664420b00c4ab28491bc.webm?t=1723697668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950300/extras/99c8dd26f23e664420b00c4ab28491bc.mp4?t=1723697668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Fast-paced hack-n-slash</strong> combat!<br></li><li>Use your magic brush to unleash color powers to face the darkness<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950300/extras/fb20c10c4e5329cdea5cea0bfc8a663a.poster.avif?t=1723697668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950300/extras/fb20c10c4e5329cdea5cea0bfc8a663a.webm?t=1723697668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950300/extras/fb20c10c4e5329cdea5cea0bfc8a663a.mp4?t=1723697668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Traverse a dreamlike landscape</strong> with colorful environments!<br></li><li>See how a dying world is <strong>brought back to life</strong> when the color returns!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950300/extras/e49f3f56059b8e4af25aa606217b2a1a.poster.avif?t=1723697668\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950300/extras/e49f3f56059b8e4af25aa606217b2a1a.webm?t=1723697668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1950300/extras/e49f3f56059b8e4af25aa606217b2a1a.mp4?t=1723697668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Experience Jonah\u2019s deeply personal story of self-discovery<br></li><li>Discover the untold secret of this world<br></li><li>Fight a variety of dark enemies each with its own challenge<br></li><li>Recolor the world! The more you paint the world the stronger your color powers become!</li></ul>",
